go2_description
================

The URDF description and DAE meshes in the `urdf/` and `dae/` directories are
derived from the Unitree Go2 robot model distributed in the `unitree_ros`
repository (https://github.com/unitreerobotics/unitree_ros), specifically the
`robots/go2_description` package.

